; WHO 22 sound diffusion: the parameter forms WHAT#P#1 and WHAT#4#P for WHAT 35 on the
; amplifier 3#1#1.
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: P 0..20, 50, 99,
; 100, 255, 256, 1000 in every series; the WHAT#4#P series have no P = 1. The same forms for
; WHAT 0 and 1 are in sound-who22-what-parameters.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

